Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:03.59,Tarja,,0,0,0,,Eu acho que o principal objetivo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:05.83,Tarja,,0,0,0,,é as empresas começarem de uma forma
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:07.63,Tarja,,0,0,0,,organizada, com governança,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:09.91,Tarja,,0,0,0,,entenderem o benefício que isso
